gbaren Version.</li>\n                    <li>Browser-Erweiterungen <strong>(Add-ons)</strong>: Bitte pr\u00fcfen Sie, ob verwendete Erweiterungen notwendige Anfragen blockieren (z. B. Werbe-/Tracking-Blocker, Script-Blocker).</li>\n                    <li>Proxy/VPN: Es besteht keine Verbindung \u00fcber einen <strong>Proxy</strong> oder ein <strong>VPN</strong>. Falls doch, trennen Sie diese Verbindung bitte und versuchen Sie es anschlie\u00dfend ohne Proxy/VPN erneut.</li>\n                </ul></br>\n                <p>Sollten die Herausforderungen trotz Pr\u00fcfung aller Punkte weiterhin bestehen, kontaktieren Sie uns bitte unter Nennung der angezeigten Ref-ID (maximal 48 Stunden g\u00fcltig) unter:</p>\n            </section>\n\n            <section lang=\"en\">\n                <p>For security reasons, we unfortunately had to deny access to our data.<br/></p>\n                <h2 style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:18px;\">To ensure you can continue to access it, please make sure the following requirements are met:</h2></br>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Operating system: Your OS version is no more than <strong>6 months</strong> older than the latest available version.</li>\n                    <li>Browser: Your browser version is no more than <strong>12 months</strong> older than the latest available version.</li>\n                    <li>Browser extensions <strong>(Add-ons)</strong>: Please check whether any extensions you are using are blocking required requests (e.g., ad/tracking blockers, script blockers).</li>\n                    <li>Proxy/VPN: You are not connected via a <strong>Proxy</strong> or <strong>VPN</strong>. If you are, please disconnect and then try again without a proxy/VPN.\n</li>\n                </ul></br>\n                <p>If the issue persists, despite checking all of the above, please contact us\u2014 quoting the displayed Ref ID (valid for a maximum of 48 hours) \u2014at:</p>\n            </section>\n\n            